    "a11yText": "Non-interactive avatars use role=\"img\" with an accessible name. Interactive avatars use role=\"button\", are focusable, and fire host click (Enter/Space included). Decorative inner content is aria-hidden. Image alt=\"\"; name lives on the host.",
